  unitName: Sky Goddess Raquel
  unitId: 50085
  unitNumber: 754
  description: 'This goddess is the living manifestation of war, known as Legendary
    Jona''s true form while on the battlefield. Her motives are plain and simple:
    challenging the strong means everything. Records state that she fought to save
    the human race, but this is not completely true. The reason being that as soon
    as she had finished bringing down a powerful god, she then pointed her sword
    at a human hero. The blade that had once carried the hopes of the human race
    would now bring despair instead.'
  summonDesc: Let us run around the battlefield<br>and bask in the glory of victory!<br>Come,
    we leave immediately!
  fusionDesc: Thanks for the offerings.<br>However, what I really want<br>is to fight
    you now.
  evoDesc: Battle and battle to the bitter end.<br>Fighting is living.<br>I shall
    teach this to you.
  element: 5
  rarity: 5
